OL,3,GNEWSATwo police officers among seven
OL,4,Akilled in pursued car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people including two police
OL,7,Fofficers have been killed in a crash
OL,8,Fwith a car driving the wrong way down a
OL,9,Fdual-carriageway following a pursuit.
OL,11,FA Volkswagen Passat with five occupants
OL,12,Fsaid to be in their late teens struck
OL,13,Fan oncoming marked Cleveland Police
OL,14,Fvehicle on the A66 near Middlesbrough
OL,15,Fat about 03:39 BST.
OL,17,FThe BBC understands a pursuit of the
OL,18,Fcar had been called off before the
OL,19,Fcrash, with the police vehicle just
OL,20,Fhappening to be in the South Bank area.
OL,21,FThe occupants of both cars were
OL,22,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
